<div class="overview-grid premium-overview"><section class="panel fleet-section"><h2>3. Register the vehicle in TEVERA</h2><ol class="setup-steps"><li>Open <a href="{{ route('vehicles.create') }}">Add vehicle / device</a> and select the correct company if you are a platform administrator.</li><li>Enter the vehicle name, registration and exact tracker identifier. Record the model, SIM number and protocol.</li><li>Save and check that device synchronization succeeds. If it fails, resolve the reported error before retrying.</li><li>Assign operator/customer users who should see this vehicle.</li></ol><p class="muted">Entering an IMEI does not locate a device by itself. The tracker must send its GPS reports to your server.</p></section>
