<section class="panel fleet-section"><h2>Using a phone instead?</h2><p>Install <a href="https://www.traccar.org/client/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Traccar Client</a> on a phone you are authorized to track. Register the identifier shown in the app as the vehicle's tracker ID in TEVERA.</p><p><strong>Phone server URL:</strong> @if($clientUrl)<code>{{ $clientUrl }}</code>@else Not configured — ask your administrator for the full receiver URL.@endif</p><p>Traccar Client uses the OsmAnd receiver (configured port <strong>{{ $phonePort }}</strong>). Enter a full URL, including its scheme and port where needed. Use the phone receiver address rather than TEVERA's login URL. Grant location/background permissions and start reporting. For same-Wi-Fi testing only, an example is <code>http://YOUR-PC-LAN-IP:{{ $phonePort }}</code>; replace the placeholder. Public HTTPS needs a receiver endpoint configured for it.</p><a href="https://www.traccar.org/client-configuration/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official phone configuration instructions</a></section>
